{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--ink:#1d1d1f;--muted:#6b6b6f;--accent:#6b8c7a;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}
    header{position:relative;padding:28px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    nav a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;margin:0 12px;font-size:14px}
    .brand{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    main{max-width:1000px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding:28px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,140,122,0.06),transparent);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.03)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    .hero p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* two column layout for content blocks */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)}

    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e9;font-size:14px;background:white}
    textarea{min-height:100px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    /* Session Planner */
    .plan-output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f7f9f8;border:1px dashed #e1e7e4;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
    button{cursor:pointer;border:0;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#eef6f2}

    /* Wizard */
    .wizard-step{display:none}
    .wizard-step.active{display:block}
    .wizard-questions{margin-top:12px}
    .question{margin-bottom:12px}

    footer{margin:40px 0 80px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* subtle pattern using inline data svg background */
    .patterned{background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="400" height="120" viewBox="0 0 400 120"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%236b8c7a" stop-opacity="0.06"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%236b8c7a" stop-opacity="0.01"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="400" height="120" fill="white"/><g fill="url(%23g)" opacity="0.9"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle cx="90" cy="50" r="14"/><rect x="140" y="10" width="40" height="40" rx="8"/></g><g fill="%236b8c7a" opacity="0.06"><path d="M300 80c12-20 34-28 52-18v36c-18 10-40 2-52-18z"/></g></svg>');background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right top}

    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.patterned{background-position:center top}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
      <a href="book.html">Start</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero patterned card">
      <h1>Reach out. We’ll make a thoughtful beginning.</h1>
      <p>A simple space to ask, plan, and prepare—so the first meeting can be about you, not logistics.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:12px">
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <span style="margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Call: {{PHONE}} • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Contact form</h2>
          <p class="muted">Tell me briefly why you’re reaching out and what matters most right now. I’ll get back within 3–5 business days.</p>
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First and last" />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" />

            <label for="message">A brief note</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What would you like me to know before we meet?"></textarea>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="cta" id="submitContact">Send</button>
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Or use the self-tools below to prepare a plan or questions.</div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="muted">Build a short, clear plan to bring to our first conversation. This is a personal working note—non-binding, non-diagnostic.</p>

          <label for="goal">Primary focus</label>
          <select id="goal">
            <option value="Managing stress and overwhelm">Managing stress and overwhelm</option>
            <option value="Improving relationships">Improving relationships</option>
            <option value="Navigating life changes">Navigating life changes</option>
            <option value="Mood and motivation">Mood and motivation</option>
            <option value="Something else">Something else</option>
          </select>

          <label for="frequency">Preferred cadence</label>
          <select id="frequency">
            <option>Weekly</option>
            <option>Every other week</option>
            <option>Short series (4–6 sessions)</option>
            <option>Occasional check-ins</option>
          </select>

          <label for="sessionLength">Session length</label>
          <select id="sessionLength">
            <option>50 minutes</option>
            <option>75 minutes</option>
            <option>30 minutes (brief)</option>
          </select>

          <label for="notes">A few priorities (bullet points)</label>
          <textarea id="notes" placeholder="e.g., sleep concerns; communication with partner; decision support"></textarea>

          <div class="controls">
            <button id="buildPlan">Build plan</button>
            <button id="clearPlan">Clear</button>
            <button id="downloadPlan">Download .txt</button>
            <button id="copyPlan">Copy summary</button>
          </div>

          <div id="planOutput" class="plan-output" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Self‑screening intake — a guided reflection</h3>
          <p class="muted">Short, supportive prompts to help you notice patterns and gather questions for our time together. This is not a diagnosis—it's a way to prepare.</p>

          <div id="wizard">
            <div class="wizard-step active" data-step="1">
              <div class="question">
                <label>1) What feels most urgent to address right now?</label>
                <input id="w1" placeholder="One sentence" />
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button data-next="2" class="wizard-nav">Next</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="2">
              <div class="question">
                <label>2) When you notice this pattern, what do you typically do?</label>
                <input id="w2" placeholder="Reactive steps, avoidant moves, helpful routines" />
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button data-prev="1" class="wizard-nav">Back</button>
                <button data-next="3" class="wizard-nav">Next</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="wizard-step" data-step="3">
              <div class="question">
                <label>3) What would feel like progress after three sessions?</label>
                <input id="w3" placeholder="A small, observable change" />
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button data-prev="2" class="wizard-nav">Back</button>
                <button id="finishWizard">Finish</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="wizardOutput" class="plan-output" style="margin-top:12px;display:none"></div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <button id="copyWizard" style="display:none">Copy questions for consultation</button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Practical info</h4>
          <p class="muted">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Sessions available in person and via secure video when appropriate. Insurance and sliding scale options discussed during intake.</p>
          <h5 style="margin-bottom:6px">Confidentiality & scope</h5>
          <p class="muted">Therapeutic conversations are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I will explain the boundaries of our work, what I can offer, and when a referral may be needed.</p>
          <h5 style="margin-bottom:6px">Crisis note</h5>
          <p class="muted">If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a medical emergency, call local emergency services right away. If you are thinking about harming yourself or others, contact emergency services or a crisis line in your area.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Quick links</h4>
          <ul style="padding-left:18px;margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)">
            <li><a href="about.html">Who I Am</a></li>
            <li><a href="specialties.html">Areas I work with</a></li>
            <li><a href="fees.html">Investment</a></li>
            <li><a href="book.html">Start</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div class="card" style="padding:14px">
        <strong>Notes on care</strong>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0">My approach is collaborative, evidence-informed, and tuned to your pace. I will not promise outcomes; instead, I offer steady clinical attention, thoughtful questions, and practical steps between sessions.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Session Planner
    function buildPlanText() {
      var goal = document.getElementById('goal').value;
      var freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
      var length = document.getElementById('sessionLength').value;
      var notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();
      var name = (document.getElementById('name').value || '—');
      var email = (document.getElementById('email').value || '—');

      var lines = [];
      lines.push('Plan created for: ' + name);
      lines.push('Contact: ' + email + ' • ' + (document.getElementById('phone').value || '—'));
      lines.push('Primary focus: ' + goal);
      lines.push('Preferred cadence: ' + freq);
      lines.push('Session length: ' + length);
      if (notes) {
        lines.push('Priorities:');
        notes.split('\n').forEach(function(l){ lines.push('- ' + l); });
      }
      lines.push('\nNotes to clinician:');
      lines.push('I would like to explore the items above and consider small practical steps to try between sessions.');
      lines.push('\nGenerated with intent — not a formal intake.');
      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var out = buildPlanText();
      var el = document.getElementById('planOutput');
      el.textContent = out;
    });

    document.getElementById('clearPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.getElementById('notes').value = '';
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent = '';
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      if(!text) return alert('Build a plan first.');
      if(navigator.clipboard){
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){ alert('Plan copied to clipboard.'); });
      } else {
        var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); try{document.execCommand('copy'); alert('Plan copied.');}catch(e){alert('Copy failed.')} ta.remove();
      }
    });

    // Download plan as .txt
    document.getElementById('downloadPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent || buildPlanText();
      var blob = new Blob([text], {type: 'text/plain'});
      var a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
      document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove();
    });

    // Wizard logic
    function showStep(n){
      document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-step').forEach(function(s){ s.classList.remove('active'); });
      var el = document.querySelector('.wizard-step[data-step="'+n+'"]');
      if(el) el.classList.add('active');
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-nav').forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        var next = btn.getAttribute('data-next');
        var prev = btn.getAttribute('data-prev');
        if(next) showStep(next);
        if(prev) showStep(prev);
      });
    });

    document.getElementById('finishWizard').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var a = document.getElementById('w1').value.trim();
      var b = document.getElementById('w2').value.trim();
      var c = document.getElementById('w3').value.trim();
      var lines = [];
      lines.push('Reflection summary');
      lines.push('---------------');
      if(a) lines.push('What feels urgent: ' + a);
      if(b) lines.push('Typical responses or routines: ' + b);
      if(c) lines.push('Short-term progress goal: ' + c);
      lines.push('\nQuestions to bring to the consultation:');
      if(a) lines.push('- How can I begin to address: "' + a + '"?');
      if(b) lines.push('- Are there small experiments to change my typical responses?');
      if(c) lines.push('- What would be a realistic plan to notice the change I want in three sessions?');
      lines.push('\n(These prompts are for discussion, not a diagnosis.)');

      var out = lines.join('\n');
      var box = document.getElementById('wizardOutput');
      box.style.display = 'block';
      box.textContent = out;
      document.getElementById('copyWizard').style.display = 'inline-block';
      // scroll into view
      box.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
    });

    document.getElementById('copyWizard').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = document.getElementById('wizardOutput').textContent;
      if(!text) return alert('Complete the reflection first.');
      if(navigator.clipboard){ navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){ alert('Reflection copied.'); }); }
    });

    // Simple form stub: don't actually send — prepare a small draft message
    document.getElementById('submitContact').addEventListener('click', function(){
      var name = document.getElementById('name').value || '—';
      var email = document.getElementById('email').value || '—';
      var message = document.getElementById('message').value || '—';
      var draft = 'Contact request from: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\nMessage:\n' + message;
      alert('This site does not submit forms automatically. Copy the message below to paste into an email if you prefer:\n\n' + draft);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and tools — chunk 4 for private_practice_therapist-MORE-2026-02-17T08-50-34-600Z-045

Files included:
- contact.html : The contact page with two local interactive tools: Session Planner and Self-screening intake (guided reflection). It also includes a contact form stub, practical notes about confidentiality, scope, and a crisis note.

Purpose of the page:
- Offer a calm entry point to contact the clinician and prepare for the first meeting.
- Session Planner: build a short plaintext plan, copy to clipboard, or download as a .txt file.
- Self-screening intake (guided reflection): 3-step wizard that produces a concise reflection and a short list of questions to bring to consultation; copyable to clipboard.

Placeholders used (must be replaced in deployment):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on behavior and constraints:
- All logic is local JS; no external services or network calls.
- The contact form does not submit to a server (intentional stub). The submit button shows a draft message the user can copy into their email client.
- Session Planner exports a plaintext summary and supports copy + download.
- The guided reflection is non-diagnostic, supportive, and produces "Questions to bring" — suitable for preparing a consultation.

Therapist/legal content:
- The page includes confidentiality and scope language and a crisis note; there are no medical claims or promises of outcomes.
- Avoids manipulative scarcity language.

Design notes:
- Minimal, poetic copy voice and a soft, muted palette.
- Pattern is embedded via an inline data-URL SVG for subtle visual texture (no external assets required in this chunk).

How to test locally:
1. Open contact.html in a browser.
2. Use the Session Planner: choose options, write notes, click "Build plan" then try "Copy summary" and "Download .txt".
3. Use the wizard: complete steps, click "Finish" then "Copy questions for consultation".
4. Try the contact form stub and observe the draft popup.

Accessibility & small details:
- Forms have simple labels and aria-live on the plan output for polite updates.
- The page is responsive and stacks to a single column on narrow viewports.

If you need the separate SVG asset saved as assets/img/pattern.svg, copy the SVG content from the background data URI in contact.html and save it to that path. "} 
